OL,3,AFire at nursing home in Chile kills 16
OL,4,Aresidents
OL,5,
OL,6,FChile's President Jose Antonio Kast
OL,7,Fsaid he had ordered a review into the
OL,8,Fcondition of nursing homes across the
OL,9,Fcountry.
